{"about_the_game":"Build spaceships with your friends, and engage in intense combat inside and outside of your ship! An intuitive ship-building tool allows you to create small starfighters or large capital ships and space-stations. Customize pre-built ships or create your own from scratch with collectible materials and interactive objects, then explore your friends' ships... or destroy them!<br><br>Current Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Ship and Space-Station Building</strong><br><i>Design your ship with an array of objects and materials, or customize a pre-built design.</i><br></li><li><strong>Ship Combat</strong><br><i>Place weapons on your ship to unleash a barrage of lasers and other attacks!</i><br></li><li><strong>Player Combat</strong><br><i>Battle players inside and outside of your creations.</i><br></li><li><strong>Player Controlled and Auto-Pilot Flight</strong><br><i>Roam your ship while another player navigates, or set it to auto-pilot and watch the stars drift past!</i><br></li><li><strong>Docking</strong><br><i>Land smaller ships inside larger ones and bring your fleet of fighters with you.</i><br></li><li><strong>Teleportation</strong><br><i>Sneak onto an enemy's ship by teleporting.</i></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"2ff55422d10bad806a7b30ad0eceec0782d2604c.jpg","localized_name":"Captain on Deck!","name":"Captain on Deck!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/810050/2ff55422d10bad806a7b30ad0eceec0782d2604c.jpg"},{"icon":"cb4f424f6aa8735c8bb3fba43405a3bc8bf74f56.jpg","localized_name":"Engage!","name":"Engage!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/810050/cb4f424f6aa8735c8bb3fba43405a3bc8bf74f56.jpg"},{"icon":"c392bef78788db5dd52d43243bc85381caf846e7.jpg","localized_name":"1,000 Circuits!","name":"1,000 Circuits!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/810050/c392bef78788db5dd52d43243bc85381caf846e7.jpg"